---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/Base.astro";

const title = "河北丝网工厂：不止安平";
const description = "河北省的丝网产业不限于安平县。了解区域专业化、物流优势以及如何评估河北制造商。";
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">河北丝网：区域概览</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-theme-muted max-w-2xl">
        虽然安平县主导着河北的丝网生产，但其他地区也各具优势。了解全貌有助于您制定采购策略。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-4 text-sm text-theme-muted">
    <a href="/zh/" class="hover:text-theme-accent">首页</a> / 河北丝网
  </nav>

  <article class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <!-- Hebei Context -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">河北的丝网产业</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        河北省环绕北京和天津，拥有通往中国首都经济圈和主要港口的
        绝佳物流条件。该省的工业基础包括
        钢铁生产、金属加工和丝网制造——形成了天然的
        垂直整合。
      </p>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        河北丝网制造的主要特征：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>原材料优势</strong> — 邻近大型钢铁企业，降低丝材成本</li>
        <li><strong>港口物流</strong> — 天津港（新港）承担大量丝网出口</li>
        <li><strong>产业集聚</strong> — 配套产业（镀锌、PVC 包塑、包装）就近布局</li>
        <li><strong>成本结构</strong> — 土地和劳动力成本低于沿海地区</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Regional Specializations -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">区域专业化</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        河北不同地区形成了不同的丝网专业化方向：
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">地区</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">专业化方向</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">备注</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">安平县</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">全品类丝网</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">产业中心，产品范围最广</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">衡水地区</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">包胶网、特种产品</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">新兴集群，部分注重创新</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">石家庄</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">分销、贸易公司</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">省会，物流枢纽</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">天津走廊</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">出口加工、港口物流</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">便于出口导向型订单</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Hebei vs Other Regions -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">河北与其他制造区域的对比</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        河北与中国其他丝网制造区域相比如何？
      </p>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-4">
        <table class="w-full text-sm">
          <thead class="bg-theme-tertiary">
            <tr>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">地区</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">优势</th>
              <th class="text-left p-3 font-semibold text-theme-primary">注意事项</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-theme">
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">河北（安平）</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">完整供应链、有竞争力的价格、产品多样</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">质量差异大；尽职调查必不可少</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">江苏（南通）</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">更高精度的网材、技术纺织品</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">价格更高，标准产品规模较小</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">广东</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">出口经验丰富，邻近香港物流</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">成本更高，丝网专业化程度较低</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="p-3 font-medium text-theme-primary">浙江</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">通用金属制品、贸易网络</td>
              <td class="p-3 text-theme-secondary">丝网专业化程度较低</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Evaluating Hebei Factories -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">如何评估河北丝网工厂</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        无论具体位置如何，以下因素有助于甄别可靠的河北制造商：
      </p>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">生产设备</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            现代化织机（精密网采用瑞士或德国织机）、
            稳定的拉丝能力、自有镀锌生产线。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">质量体系</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            出口导向工厂普遍具备 ISO 9001 认证。
            请索要质量手册和近期的第三方审核报告。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">出口业绩</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            要求提供您所在地区买家的参考案例。成熟的出口商
            应能提供可联系的推荐人。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-theme rounded p-4">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-2">技术能力</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">
            能否按国际标准（ASTM、DIN、JIS）生产？
            是否理解您应用场景的要求？
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Logistics -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">从河北发货的物流</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary mb-4">
        河北的地理位置提供多种运输选择：
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-theme-secondary space-y-2 mb-4">
        <li><strong>天津港（新港）</strong> — 主要出口门户，距安平约 2-3 小时车程</li>
        <li><strong>青岛港</strong> — 发往南美和非洲货物的备选</li>
        <li><strong>上海港</strong> — 用于部分拼箱货物</li>
        <li><strong>铁路选项</strong> — 中欧班列，适用于内陆目的地</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-theme-secondary">
        大多数工厂可办理出口单证，但请在下单前明确责任划分
        （EXW、FOB、CIF 条款）。我们的<a href="/zh/sourcing-guide/" class="text-theme-accent hover:underline">采购指南</a>详细讲解了
        国际贸易术语。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Related Pages -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-theme-primary mb-4">继续探索</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/anping-wire-mesh/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">安平丝网</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">深入产业中心</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/sourcing-guide/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">采购指南</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">分步采购流程</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/procurement-process/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">采购流程</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">从询价到交付的工作流程</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/factories/" class="block p-4 border border-theme rounded hover:border-theme-accent transition">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-theme-primary mb-1">工厂目录</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-theme-secondary">浏览经过核验的制造商</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="bg-theme-secondary text-white rounded p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">从河北采购？</h2>
      <p class="text-theme-muted mb-4">发送您的需求，我们将帮您找到合适的制造商。</p>
      <a href="/inquiry/" class="inline-block accent-bg hover:accent-bg text-theme-primary font-semibold px-6 py-2 rounded transition">
        提交询盘
      </a>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
